    "youtubeId": "w1tDY0pPq3w",
    "title": "The -ed Song | Learn Past Tense",
    "channel": "Nessy"
  },
  "steps": [
    "Past tense tells about something that ALREADY happened.",
    "Most verbs add -ed: jump → jumped, play → played, walk → walked.",
    "Some verbs change completely: go → went, eat → ate, run → ran.",
    "'Was' and 'were' are past tense of is/are: 'She WAS happy. They WERE at school.'"
  ],
